cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "siwuya-data: A public data foundation for value-investing research"
abstract: >
  A public, structured data foundation for value-investing research, including
  company profiles (CN/HK/US listed), an integrity-scoring framework for
  evaluating management promise fulfillment, and reusable research templates.
